<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales rose 8.6 pct in October.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales rose 8.6 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Friday its sales for October were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	    +8.6		   32,464	   29,891</p>
<p>   Cars	     -0.2		   17,673	   17,705</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +21.4		   14,791	   12,186</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	   -2.4		   322,342	  330,909</p>
<p>   Cars	    -6.0		   187,514	  199,563</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +3.0		   135,342	  131,346</p>
<p>-- Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
